{"t":"Death Ring","s":"death-ring-572dd","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Death_Ring_3cdd8c.gif","q":10,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Death Ring</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Death Ring\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Ring_3cdd8c.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attrib\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attributes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">shielding -10</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"armor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Armor</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resist\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Resists</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">death +5%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Rings</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.80 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.5 minutes</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 - 4,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20061210222049&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Ring_3cdd8c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a death ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:1, shielding -10, protection death +5%)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Wearing it makes you feel a little weaker than usual.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Death rings were once one of the oldest items in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>. It was replaced in an update by <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a> at the same time the other magical rings were introduced. It reduces your shielding by 10 points and has energy for 7 minutes 30 seconds. Quite valued on the market nowadays since they can be used as quest items and useful in wars because of its death protection. Using a death ring when your shield skill is originally 10, it is reduced down to 0. It's also worth mentioning that even though shield is reduced by 10 levels, <b>your shielding skill won't go up faster</b>. The value of the ring decreased after Christmas Update 2007 because since then it is obtainable from quests. The attributes are only shown when worn.\nTwo of them are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/dreamers-challenge-quest\">Dreamer's Challenge Quest</a>.<br/>One can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/into-the-bone-pit-quest\">Into the Bone Pit Quest</a>.<br/>Another can be obtained every year at Lightbearer event.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before December 2002, there was an item called the \"Death Ring.\" After December 2002, all death rings were turned into the current <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a>.\n</p><p>In the 7.9 Update, the current incarnation of the \"Death Ring\" was added to the game with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a> and many strong creatures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Adlerauge\">Adlerauge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Mariner\">Blight Mariner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelords%27s%20Phylactery\">Bonelords's Phylactery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bretzecutioner\">Bretzecutioner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Book\">Burning Book</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clavius\">Clavius</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfire%20Asura\"